  "goodToKnow": "Die Skulptur is a sculpture; a synonym is die Plastik, which also means plastic. The artist is der Bildhauer (die Bildhauerin), literally image-hewer. Münster hosts the Skulptur Projekte every ten years (most recently 2017), placing works across the city, and Kassel's documenta has left sculptures in its parks too. German sculptors include Tilman Riemenschneider, Käthe Kollwitz and Ernst Barlach. Plural: die Skulpturen."
